  "sfx": {
    "auto": "From each capture's cursor.json (template shotCues): click → ios_tink −12 dB; every typed character → one keystroke (key_1..7, sliced from macbook_keyboard) −18 dB ±1.5 dB; every zoom-in → whoosh_short −20 dB, 2 frames early.",
